79: * Describes which view to show with which state, without actually mounting anything.
80: * The slot reads this descriptor and handles the lifecycle: mount if new, sync if
81: * the same view is already shown, or destroy-and-remount if the constructor changed.
83: * An optional key forces a remount when it changes, even if the view class is the same.
